body:
Abhijeet Dipke, founder of the Cockroach Janta Party (CJP), has announced his return from the United States on June 6 to lead a peaceful protest at Jantar Mantar in Delhi over the NEET-UG 2026 paper leak controversy. Dipke demanded the resignation of Union Education Minister Dharmendra Pradhan, alleging that the exam scandal has impacted more than 2.28 million students across the country.

@abhijeet_dipke 
@CJP_2029

