body:
@Cockroachisback @abhijeet_dipke @Uppolice @dgpup 

Pls don’t allow such political drama. 1st Jantar Mantar, then Pan India protests, and now new demands every few days.

To all NEET aspirants: ur exam is on 21st. Focus on ur studies &amp; future. Don’t let anyone use students as a ladder for their political career.

