body:
In Photos | Activist Sonam Wangchuk continued his indefinite hunger strike at Jantar Mantar in New Delhi on Friday, expressing solidarity with the Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) and demanding the immediate resignation of Union Education Minister Dharmendra Pradhan over alleged paper leak irregularities during the NEET-UG 2026 medical entrance examinations (17/07).

📸: Ritik Jain / UNI

