body:
Cockroach Janta Party founder Abhijeet Dipke warned of renewed nationwide protests if cases against NEET-UG 2026 demonstrators are not withdrawn. His remarks came after the Supreme Court allowed investigations to continue, while police said thousands at the protests had criminal records.
